# a hand-made instance of the three objectives (encopt.5, format 2): one forced form, three candidates of the same code space of which only one fits the budget.
# demand STATIC DYNAMIC BASE OPS K CANDIDATE...
#   d1: often in the corpus, rarely executed, A shortens it by 2 bytes     d2: rare in the corpus, executed a lot, B shortens it by 2 bytes
#   d3: a compare-and-branch that no form reaches (6 bytes and two operations), C reaches it in 2 bytes and one operation
# static picks A, fetch picks B, exec picks C
encopt-input 2
budget 16384 65536
form F forced 1 3 0 f1
form A cand 1 3 0 a1
form B cand 1 3 0 b1
form C cand 1 3 0 c1
demand 100 1 4 1 1 0
demand 1 100 4 1 1 1
demand 10 10 6 2 1 2
committed A
